&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sofia&lt;/strong&gt; toured with &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; twice (Confessions Tour, Sticky &amp;amp; Sweet Tour) and most recently performed  alongside her at the Super Bowl halftime show.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;It's amazing to work with her. She's a really strong woman and she's really inspiring,&quot; &lt;strong&gt;Sofia&lt;/strong&gt; said. &quot;Working  with her taught me a lot in terms of discipline and what it takes to  accomplish what you want artistically. She's also a great woman and an  amazing mother. It has been eight years since I started working with  her.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
