		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedImage&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.drownedmadonna.com//media/k2/items/cache/f14a855e71266fce000280ce97ff2b84_S.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Exclusive interview with Madonna tomorrow on The Sun on Sunday&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For alll &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; UK fans who do not follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.twitter.com/drownedmadonna&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; yet, do not miss an exclusive &lt;strong&gt;interview&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; tomorrow on &lt;strong&gt;The Sun on Sunday&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
